Missing) with an icon, never color alone; every cell of the real table is a button named by its key and Locale.","Read-only state and the missing permission key are said in words next to an icon."],"constraints":["Built only from Adapter Widgets (Stack, Text, Icon, Badge, Button, Table, TableRow, TextInput, SegmentedControl, Segment, Alert, EmptyState, Skeleton); no Widget outside the Adapter catalog.","The Locale keys and their values are sample Workspace content in both render Locales, not interface copy; the in-place cell editor is a TextInput shown by a Variant, and the hover-only Remove key button, the keyboard cell navigation, the Checks reveal highlight and the Workspace pages sub-navigation are not modelled.","Every visible string of the page is bound with $i18n except the sample keys and values; en-US and zh-TW keep identical key sets.","Visual language follows the Quiet Canvas design system in DESIGN.md."],"decisions":[],"entryConditions":["A member opened Locales from the Workspace pages; every Locale file of the Workspace is read, the primary Locale (the default Locale of the Workspace settings) leading.","The base state is a desktop layout for a holder of locales.write: two Locales, one key missing from the second, one extra key it has, one empty and one whitespace-only value.","The render context selects one Workspace viewport preset, one Locale and one theme; on tablet the table is read-only and says to edit on desktop, and on a phone it becomes one read-only card per key."],"intent":"Show the Workspace Locales page as built from Adapter Widgets only: every key of every Locale file as one row of a key by Locale table, with reminders for empty, whitespace-only and missing translations, the key diff against the primary Locale, and per-Locale unsaved edits.","interactionRules":["One row stands for a key in the one global key space; each Locale file has its own column, and a Locale file is edited and saved on its own.","An empty value and a value of only spaces are marked as two separate reminders on the cell, a key the Locale lacks is marked Missing, and a key only a later Locale has is marked Not in the primary Locale; the marker never changes the stored value.","The diff lists, for each other Locale, the keys it lacks and the keys it adds against the primary Locale, with one action each to add the missing keys (empty) or remove the extra ones.","Filters narrow the rows to reminders, missing keys or extra keys with their counts, and search matches key and text; Add key adds the key to every Locale with an empty value.","A save sends the Locale's revision; a conflict keeps the draft and offers Reload theirs and Compare, a lease held by someone else shows who and until when and keeps the draft.","A member without locales.write sees the page read-only and is told which key is missing; without the primary Locale file the page says so and offers to create it."],"references":[{"label":"Phase 5 of the closed loop: dogfood coverage of the core surfaces","relation":"decision","type":"external","uri":"https://github.com/DevilTea/uiux/discussions/379#discussioncomment-19257377"}],"requirements":["01a115cd-b1f1-7c39-9e3d-a8681847d8fa","01a115cd-b3c8-7eb7-9e04-c152d1f800cc","01a115cd-b428-7f64-9c13-612ad4869d8d","01a115cd-b3f8-7892-aa90-f121287ffdc6","01a116f0-9059-7ec4-a560-35159d01e56e"]},"variants":{"add-key":{"state":{"add-key-form":{"visible":true},"new-key-error":{"visible":false},"new-key-taken":{"visible":false}}},"add-key-required":{"state":{"add-key-form":{"visible":true},"new-key":{"invalid":true},"new-key-error":{"visible":true}}},"add-key-taken":{"state":{"add-key-form":{"visible":true},"new-key":{"invalid":true,"value":"cart.title"},"new-key-error":{"visible":false},"new-key-taken":{"visible":true}}},"cell-editing":{"requirements":["01a115cd-b428-7f64-9c13-612ad4869d8d"],"state":{"c2-en-editor":{"visible":true},"c2-en-row":{"visible":false}}},"conflict":{"requirements":["01a11485-f451-72eb-81ad-686aeec7b3eb"],"st